<title>GERMANY: Daimler says 4-month sales climb 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Daimler says 4-month sales climb 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>January to end of April 1997. (in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>						     sales     pct chg</p>
<p>    Group net sales			    36,300	+15</p>
<p>    Passenger car sales			16,200	+14</p>
<p>    Commercial vehicle sales		 11,600	+15</p>
<p>    Daimler-Benz aerospace		    3,900	+39</p>
<p>    Daimler-Benz services		     4,700	+17</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German industrial group is Daimler-Benz AG.</p>
<p>--Bonn Newsroom + 49-228 26097150</p>
